{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202607kKySYySq1795782407.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>泰國曼谷最大二手市集大火燒毀逾百個攤檔，沒有人受傷，鄰近學校停課。</p><p></p><p>位於納瓦明路的帕塔維功市集，周五清晨五時發生大火。由於攤檔內，存放大量衣物及貨品，加上多數為帆布帳篷結構，助長火勢蔓延。消防人員用了近一個半小時，才將火勢撲滅。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.FIRE-1700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TlH1lkPLYA1795782416.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>當局在市集旁邊設立登記站，估計約100名商販受影響，已率先向每人發放11400泰銖，折合約2600港幣的初步援助金，後續將依政府規定提供進一步幫助。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.FIRE-1700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YdiLDT7KJJ1795782432.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>受火災及濃煙影響，市集附近一間中學當天停課。曼谷市長早上到火災現場視察，呼籲民眾在清理期間避開周邊道路，並提醒市民用火時提高警覺。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T13:03:55.346866+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T13:37:19.906473+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:18.437658+00:00","content_hash":"2c61471b557597a0ada37473644b358bbfd4e25b2a3624925cfcc337a0f6bcff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}